1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,080
(Sheldon:)Sorry, I have company.

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,830
(Raj:)Come on, Sheldon, open the door.

3
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:13,140
(Sheldon:)I don't want to hug you.

4
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:14,500
(Sheldon:)I don't want to
hug you, either.

5
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:15,870
(Raj:)I was just
feeling blue.

6
00:00:15,870 --> 00:00:18,710
(Sheldon:)Blue, as in depressed.

7
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:20,840
(Raj:)Well, not so much
depressed as lonely.

8
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:23,810
(Sheldon:)I don't know what
color lonely is.

9
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:25,850
(Leonard:)- What?
- Red is angry;

10
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:27,450
yellow is frightened;

11
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:30,690
green is jealous;
and blue is depressed.

12
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:33,860
(Sheldon:)Perhaps we can assign
a color to lonely.

13
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:37,860
(Raj:)Nothing rhymes with orange.
It's probably lonely.

14
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:40,860
(Sheldon:)All right. Come in.

15
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:43,530
(Sheldon:)You look positively
orange with loneliness.

16
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,390
(Sheldon:)No, I don't see that
catching on at all.

17
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:49,310
(Raj:)What are you doing?

18
00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:51,210
(Sheldon:)I'm working on my
three-person chess game.

19
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:52,840
(Raj:)Oh, cool. Can I play?

20
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:58,050
(Sheldon:)It's three-person chess.

